WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:06.460
Stannis Baratheon: Nobody knows why the Targaryens
first came to the island of Dragonstone.

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:11.440
Old Valyria was at the height of its power
and the center of the civilized world, which

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.269
ended at the Narrow Sea.

00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:21.270
Westeros was a filthy backwater with seven
kings squabbling over borders and minor glories.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.950
So much for progress.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.260
The island itself was and is nothing!

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:31.869
It had no gold or gems to lure Valyrian nobility.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:33.610
All it has is rock.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:38.800
Mostly a shiny black stone too brittle for
war and too sharp for building.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.960
The Targaryens called it Dragonglass.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.010
I call it useless.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.120
But the Targaryens managed to build a castle
here.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:53.530
Simpletons claim that they used ancient Valyrian
sorcery, forgetting that the Targaryens brought

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.810
a small army with them from Essos.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:01:03.130
There is no magic in strong backs, though
admittedly, the castle is unlike any in Westeros,

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.229
foreign and strange.

00:01:05.229 --> 00:01:12.140
If the Targaryens ever regretted their barren
outpost and longed for the comforts of home,

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:15.670
the Doom made their folly permanent.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:19.470
Valyria collapsed into the waves and was no
more.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:25.210
To look east was to see the ruin of their
homeland, the greatest civilization before

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:35.710
or since; but to look west, as Aegon realized,
was to see a fertile land, ripe for conquest.

00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:38.960
Perhaps a new Valyria.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:44.390
Though good for little else, Dragonstone proved
the perfect staging point for Aegon's invasion

00:01:44.390 --> 00:01:45.760
of Westeros.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.299
The Blackwater Bay granted easy access to
the continent.

00:01:49.299 --> 00:01:56.421
The lands there were disputed by three kingdoms:
The Reach, the Iron Islands, and the Stormlands.

00:01:56.421 --> 00:02:00.690
But their capitals were far enough away that
none of them could mount a force before Aegon

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.650
got a foothold.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:08.390
Even if their kings had been able to stop
bickering over whose problem it was.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:13.370
Then it was too late, Aegon had chosen his
first camp well.

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:18.940
With the bay to the east, the river to the
south and open fields to the north and west,

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:22.040
his army was impossible to take by surprise.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:28.830
A perfect site for an invasion and, one day,
his capital city, King's Landing.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:35.989
Brynden Tully: Aegon Targaryen landed to our
south and, as had many before him, liked the

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.919
look of the Riverlands.

00:02:37.919 --> 00:02:42.599
My ancestor Edmyn Tully led the desertion
of Riverlords to his cause and was rewarded

00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:45.670
by getting to watch King Harren burn in his
own tower.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:52.439
Catelyn Stark: On the shores of the Gods Eye
due north of the Isle of Faces rises a monument

00:02:52.439 --> 00:02:55.870
of arrogance and cruelty.

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.110
Harrenhal.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:03.599
For a people who prided themselves on their
ships, the Ironmen of old seized any chance

00:03:03.599 --> 00:03:09.099
to leave them and carved out a vast kingdom
from the peaceful Riverlords.

00:03:09.099 --> 00:03:15.510
Their empire reached its zenith under King
Harren Hoare, called "the Black" by those

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:22.249
he terrorized and by his own men, though they
meant it proudly.

00:03:22.249 --> 00:03:28.010
King Harren enslaved the Riverlands to raise
the mightiest fortress Westeros had ever seen;

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:33.499
a castle that could garrison a million men,
with walls so vast that winters would come

00:03:33.499 --> 00:03:38.930
and go and besieging armies grow old and grey
before the castle fell.

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:46.829
Five towers he ordered, reaching into the
heavens like grasping fingers, a monstrosity

00:03:46.829 --> 00:03:51.819
which he forced our people to build for their
own subjugation.

00:03:51.819 --> 00:03:57.459
But the very day the slaves laid the last
stone, Aegon Targaryen and his sisters arrived

00:03:57.459 --> 00:03:58.809
in the south.

00:03:58.809 --> 00:04:04.599
When they arrived with their small army, Harren
laughed and shut the gates.

00:04:04.599 --> 00:04:10.709
Harrenhal would have its first test and an
easy one at that.

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:12.370
It failed.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:19.400
Harrenhal could have survived all the armies
in Westeros combined, but Harren learned that

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:23.500
the tallest and thickest walls meant little
to dragons, for dragons fly.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:30.290
Brynden Tully: The problem with huge castles
is they blind you to what's outside, both

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.900
by their size and the arrogance they inspire.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:38.230
Not that the ironborn ever lacked for that.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:42.700
They take pride in their ignorance of every
trapping of civilization.

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:48.162
Though any baker could have told them that
fire turns stone walls into an oven.

00:04:48.162 --> 00:04:55.830
And so Harren the Black finally lived up to
his name, and the Riverlords swept the ironborn

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:56.980
back to the sea.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:05:01.700
Samwell Tarly: When Aegon the Conqueror came
to the Iron Islands, the Priest King Lodos

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:06.740
claimed his divine father, the ironborn's
Drowned God, had shown him krakens pulling

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.540
Aegon's ships into the deep.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:13.950
No krakens ever arrived, and even if they
had, wouldn't have stopped Aegon and his dragons

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.900
without wings of their own.

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:21.970
Confused, Lodos filled his pockets with stones
and walked into the sea to "take counsel with

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.480
his father."

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:28.810
Thousands followed him, but apparently, the
Drowned God didn't appreciate a crowd.

00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:31.890
Their corpses washed up on the Iron Islands
for years.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:38.280
Randyll Tarly: When Aegon Targaryen declared
that Westeros was now his, King Mern IX allied

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.920
with King Loren Lannister of the Westerlands.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:47.750
Together, they fought to save Westeros from
another foreign barbarian whose family practices

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.420
put decent men to shame.

00:05:49.420 --> 00:05:52.370
But the dragons won.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:59.020
The Field of Fire claimed Mern and all his
sons, grandsons, and brothers.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:04.210
Instead of using the castle for what it was
built to do, Harlen Tyrell surrendered it

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:07.070
to Aegon without a fight.

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:13.830
In exchange, Harlen was given the castle his
family had served for thousands of years with

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.490
all its attendant lands and lords.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:21.250
Margaery Tyrell: For over a thousand years,
the Greenhand's sons and grandsons ruled The

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.380
Reach as House Gardener.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:28.930
The offshoots of his daughters grew into vast
and powerful houses in their own right.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.680
Except for House Tyrell.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:35.520
We chose instead to serve our Gardener cousins
faithfully as stewards.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:40.060
To manage their stronghold of Highgarden and
the daily affairs of the Reach.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.420
Our words are "Growing Strong."

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:48.650
And under our stewardship, the Reach did just
that.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.210
As did we.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:54.350
Until a blundering king almost cost us everything.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:57.090
Aegon Targaryen had landed in Westeros.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:02.170
King Mern allied us with the Rock to repel
the upstart's army.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:07.370
One can only marvel that King Mern did not
reconsider when he saw the living dragons

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:08.370
against him.

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:14.300
Perhaps he should have sought counsel from
his trusted stewards before he set out.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.880
Then again, perhaps he did.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:25.710
At the Field of Fire, Aegon, and let us not
forget his sisters, burned the combined armies

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.560
of the Reach and Rock.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:32.390
King Mern paid for his misjudgment with his
life and that of his ancient family.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:39.810
In a day, the Reach had lost its king, its
ruling house, and most of its army.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:45.830
Thankfully for everyone, my ancestor, Harlen
Tyrell, had better sense.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:51.240
Until the maesters sorted out the entail among
Mern's cousins, Harlen, the steward was acting

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.340
lord of Highgarden.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:58.730
To ensure peace and life in the Reach, he
would yield the castle of Aegon.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:04.740
The other castles and families would then
follow, as they had since the Dawn Age.

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:10.550
Aegon had a continent to conquer, and the
fertile Reach was too valuable to raze.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:15.950
He accepted Harlen's proposal and welcomed
our lands into his kingdom.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:22.820
To show his gratitude, Aegon entitled Harlen
to Highgarden, the castle his family had served

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:29.610
for a thousand years, and made House Tyrell
his Wardens of the South, choosing us over

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.890
older, greater families in the Reach.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.990
Our House thus owed everything to the Targaryens.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:41.219
Tywin Lannister: The Lannisters reigned as
Kings of the Rock for thousands of years and

00:08:41.219 --> 00:08:44.870
worked to make it the envy of the rest of
the Seven Kingdoms.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:52.829
Our time as kings ended, however, when Aegon
Targaryen, otherwise known as Aegon the Conqueror,

00:08:52.829 --> 00:08:55.920
arrived in Westeros with his army.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:09:01.839
The last King of the Rock, King Loren Lannister,
joined forces with King Mern Gardener, the

00:09:01.839 --> 00:09:02.980
King of the Reach.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:09.740
Together, with sixty thousand men, they met
the Targaryen host in open battle.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:16.059
History tells us that Aegon unleashed all
three of his dragons, slaughtering four thousand

00:09:16.059 --> 00:09:21.540
men at what came to be known as "the Field
of Fire."

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:28.910
King Mern himself was burned alive that day,
and House Gardener turned to ash with him.

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:37.199
Seeing both the threat and opportunity the
Targaryens represented, Loren wisely surrendered

00:09:37.199 --> 00:09:41.870
and aided Aegon in his further conquest of
Westeros.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:49.339
The Lannisters were thus appointed Lords Paramount
of the Westerlands and Wardens of the West,

00:09:49.339 --> 00:09:51.269
titles we hold to this day.

00:09:51.269 --> 00:09:57.100
Brienne of Tarth: While Aegon burned the kings
of the Iron Islands, the Rock and the Reach,

00:09:57.100 --> 00:10:03.320
his fiercest commander and rumored brother,
Orys Baratheon, set out to subdue the Stormlands.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:09.190
No matter how fierce a warrior he was, no
one could have envied his task.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:14.670
Storm's End had seen thousands of years of
war and never fallen, but Argilac, the Storm

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:19.670
King, chose not to barricade himself behind
its walls and gave Orys the battle he must

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:21.110
have hoped for.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:30.260
Orys slew Argilac and took Argilac's castle,
kingdom, daughter, sigil, and House words.

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:33.029
House Baratheon became the Lord of the Stormlands.

00:10:33.029 --> 00:10:39.110
Jon Snow: When Aegon and his dragons landed
on Westeros, the Kings of the Rock and the

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:43.579
Reach sent all of their men to die to defend
their grounds.

00:10:43.579 --> 00:10:48.920
Torrhen Stark knelt to spare his people the
same fate.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.740
He placed duty above pride.

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:54.779
Sansa Stark: The south had already fallen
to Aegon and his dragons.

00:10:54.779 --> 00:10:56.779
Only the North remained.

00:10:56.779 --> 00:11:01.930
My ancestor, King Torrhen Stark, marched the
North down to the Trident and beheld Aegon's

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:08.430
army, larger than Torrhen's own by half and
with three dragons circling overhead.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:14.069
Many northern bannermen wanted to attack anyway,
claiming northern valor would carry the day.

00:11:14.069 --> 00:11:17.550
Others wanted to fall back to Moat Cailin
and make a stand there.

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:22.660
But Torrhen had heard how the armies of the
Rock and the Reach had burned on the Field

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:28.579
of Fire and had seen the fires still glowing
beneath the rubble of Harrenhal.

00:11:28.579 --> 00:11:35.089
He knelt and laid his ancient crown as Aegon's
feet and rose a king no more but Lord of Winterfell

00:11:35.089 --> 00:11:37.899
and Warden of the North.

00:11:37.899 --> 00:11:43.709
Some Northerners still sneer at my ancestor
as "The King Who Knelt," forgetting that because

00:11:43.709 --> 00:11:46.020
of Torrhen, they're alive today to sneer.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:50.610
Their ancestors didn't leave their burned
bones at the Trident, and their twisted swords

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.869
didn't fill Aegon's new throne.

00:11:52.869 --> 00:11:58.250
Petyr Baelish: No army in the Seven Kingdoms
can match the pride and chivalry of the Knights

00:11:58.250 --> 00:11:59.699
of the Vale.

00:11:59.699 --> 00:12:04.040
After all, they were the first true knights
in Westeros.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.480
Until the dragons changed the game.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:12.389
When Aegon the Conqueror landed in Westeros,
the Queen Regent of the Vale shut the Bloody

00:12:12.389 --> 00:12:17.949
Gate against the Targaryens and massed the
Knights of the Vale behind it to lock it.

00:12:17.949 --> 00:12:23.559
But Visenya simply flew her dragon to a balcony
of the Eyrie, where the boy king was playing

00:12:23.559 --> 00:12:28.220
and gave the boy a ride around the castle
in return for his mother's submission.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:33.860
The High Sparrow: When Aegon the Conqueror
landed in Westeros, the High Septon locked

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:37.529
himself in a sept for seven days and seven
nights.

00:12:37.529 --> 00:12:43.309
Finally, the Crone lifted her golden lamp
and showed him the path ahead.

00:12:43.309 --> 00:12:49.929
The High Septon, himself, would anoint and
crown Aegon as Lord of the Seven Kingdoms;

00:12:49.929 --> 00:12:55.990
and the Faith Militant rallied behind Aegon
in governing his newly united land.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:13:00.130
Yet Aegon and his sisters never wholly accepted
the Faith.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:06.100
The High Septon had conceded Aegon's marriages
to his sisters as a relic of his Valyrian

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:08.699
heritage, which would soon fade.

00:13:08.699 --> 00:13:14.699
Ellaria Sand: Aegon Targaryen sought to unite
Westeros, as Nymeria had Dorne.

00:13:14.699 --> 00:13:18.920
The other six kingdoms fell quickly before
his dragons and ambition.

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:24.259
When his sister-wife, Rhaenys, flew her dragon
south and demanded Dorne's surrender as well,

00:13:24.259 --> 00:13:31.279
Princess Meria Martell warned, "I will not
fight you, nor will I kneel to you.

00:13:31.279 --> 00:13:32.940
Dorne has no king.

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:34.529
Tell your brother that."

00:13:34.529 --> 00:13:39.290
Rhaenys threatened that the next time the
Targaryens would come with fire and blood.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:47.730
Meria replied, "You may burn us, my lady,
but you will not bend us, break us or make

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:48.929
us bow.

00:13:48.929 --> 00:13:53.279
This is Dorne; you are not wanted here.

00:13:53.279 --> 00:13:55.149
Return at your peril!"

00:13:55.149 --> 00:13:59.540
Rhaenys did, and she died.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.610
Her dragon died.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.319
All her soldiers died.

00:14:03.319 --> 00:14:11.739
Eventually, her brother, the Conqueror, conceded
that what Nymeria had done, he could not undo.

00:14:11.739 --> 00:14:17.410
Generations later, another foolish Targaryen
invaded Dorne.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.970
He died as well.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:25.699
Eventually, we did join the Seven Kingdoms,
but when we wanted and on our terms.

